.TH strlist_join 3
.SH NAME
strlist_join \- join string list elements
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "strlist.h"
.PP
.BI "void strlist_join(strlist *" sl ", stralloc *" sa ", char " sep ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B strlist_join
concatenates the elements of
.I sl
into
.I sa
using the character
.I sep
as the separator.